The @sine-ai/provider asset contracts are adapted from the structure of
@ai-sdk/provider 4.0.34 VideoModelV4. The @sine-ai/core execution lifecycle
is adapted from ai 7.0.155 video generation, submission, and status logic.
Public helpers from @ai-sdk/provider-utils 5.0.70 are used as dependencies.

Modifications include a shared asset executor, typed asset facades,
serializable operation envelopes, explicit idempotency capabilities,
consistent deadlines and hooks, cancellation, and URL-preserving results.

The exact reviewed source files and SHA-256 hashes are listed in
upstream.json. See docs/UPSTREAM.md for provenance and intentional changes.
